   "versionNonce": 1871787531,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Answer · By cut · Across Jobs · Plan · MindMap, read only, as live; its goal-line the question's Aim; every section starts closed (▸), its state word on its right, a waiting line under one that waits on you; what it opens to is drawn under its bar, behind a dashed line;\n🙋 Interaction is every view's last section and holds its own forms; no view starts with a Waits-on-you section; the right rail: Report · Work · Studio · Interactions · Delivery · Timeline · Skills · Files, as served 261106",
   "originalText": "Answer · By cut · Across Jobs · Plan · MindMap, read only, as live; its goal-line the question's Aim; every section starts closed (▸), its state word on its right, a waiting line under one that waits on you; what it opens to is drawn under its bar, behind a dashed line;\n🙋 Interaction is every view's last section and holds its own forms; no view starts with a Waits-on-you section; the right rail: Report · Work · Studio · Interactions · Delivery · Timeline · Skills · Files, as served 261106",
